# Speech and radio

- STT: IndicWav2Vec CTC ONNX, 800 ms silence endpointer. Vosk is gone.
- TTS shipping path: VITS ONNX. Android TTS is fallback only when the graph is missing; `loadVoice` must survive missing files.
- Receive use case takes `currentLanguage` and a `TranslationEngine`. Same language → no translate.
- PTT start takes the resolved spoken language (LID/current), not hardcoded Hindi.
- Transports share `PacketCodec`. Heartbeats stay internal. Pairing code must be confirmed before content.
- Alerts and diagnostics exist in `:core`/`:android` only. Do not claim they are in the UI.
